menu "NucleoOS wake word"

config NV_WAKE_ESP_SR
    bool "Hands-free ANIMA: wake word with ESP-SR WakeNet"
    default n
    help
        Listens for a wake word fully offline (ESP-SR WakeNet) and then takes the spoken question.
        Needs the ESP-SR component and its models in the "model" flash partition:

          cd components/nv_wake && idf.py add-dependency "espressif/esp-sr^2.1"
          idf.py menuconfig   (ESP Speech Recognition > Load Multiple Wake Words: pick one or more)
          idf.py build flash  (ESP-SR flashes srmodels.bin into the "model" partition)

        Off: the feature compiles out and Settings explain it is not in this build.

endmenu
